Arena control and observation hooks for the pinned Enbility sources.

WHY: accelerated heartbeat expiry must use the same clock scale as transmission.
Pairing observations run beside native validation; they do not accept requests.
The MGCP provider's actor is corrected at its source so observations retain the
native identity rather than silently relabeling it in the adapter. Network mode
must constrain discovery, outgoing connections, and the listener consistently.

